{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop into the whimsical world of Bunnies &amp; Ballgames! This delightful sports game invites you to become an adorable woodland critter and compete on the soccer field!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Selection: Choose from a lovable lineup of cute bunnies and playful squirrels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135600/extras/7c3c84a409cd126060850c74f5ab4fa6.avif?t=1767969072\" width=900 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Gameplay: Navigate through challenging environmental hazards like slippery mud puddles and pesky rocks that will test your skills and strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135600/extras/0a0b58c52589ef5da4f653dc7b46431d.avif?t=1767969072\" width=900 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration: Venture into the critters' home to discover hidden powerup foods that increase your speed and give you the advantage during games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135600/extras/f671297461cc435c7005bc8e1e562b25.avif?t=1767969072\" width=900 height=600 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Pick a mushroom!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4135600/f464953ae426b6dce625cf08a701f06180e69084.jpg"},{"name":"Pick an apple!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4135600/d7f11daec72fbf4d9fc48f6ed56ceff8391980f3.jpg"},{"name":"Have a drink!","